  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/26C7CB">Definition <span data-tag="26C7CB">3.1.1.9</span>.</a>Xnatural@$X^{\natural }$ Let $p: X \rightarrow S$ be a Cartesian fibration of simplicial sets. We let $X^{\natural }$ denote the marked simplicial set $(X, \calE )$, where $\calE $ is the set of $p$-Cartesian edges of $X$. </p>
